  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1<br>\n<strong>Fits:</strong> Pistol weapons</p>\n<p>Adds +76 to capacity for Pistol weapons (Corgo's Capacity Chart, added to the base capacity; the sheet applies it automatically). Only one Capacity attachment at a time. The weapon only works while connected (an Action) to a worn Ammo Backpack, included. Reloading takes 2 extra Actions, the weapon can't be concealed, and it can't go in Cyberlimbs or Vehicle Heavy Weapon Mounts (ACPAs and Battlegloves are fine). Without BODY 13+, wearing the backpack gives -1 DEX and MOVE. Putting the backpack on or off is an Action, and the feed line can't be concealed.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Weapons in the 2070s &gt; Capacity Chart).</em></p>"
